      "releaseNotes": "Resolutioner is now ready for iPhone Duo! This update brings full support for iPhone Duo. The app now adapts to both screens, all poses, and all orientations.\n\nNew with v2.2.1: added iPhone Duo screenshots to the App Store listing",
